  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Standards for Market Access Programme (SMAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme has three specific objectives:-To contribute to the domestication of international standards for animal and plant-based products -To enhance the capacities of the key Kenyan institutions in the enforcement of safety standards in animal and plant based products and service delivery -To broaden the demand for SPS testing and standardization of quality in animal and plant based products.</narrative>
  </description>
